31343530","heroId":"178","skinId":"392","skinName":"寅虎·御盾","title":"廉颇_寅虎·御盾_移动语音4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"武馆授徒，只在心诚。","hasText":true,"duration":3.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/178/06584648BECC71000183134323831343530.mp3"},{"id":"06491648BECC71000183634333639383636","heroId":"178","skinId":"392","skinName":"寅虎·御盾","title":"廉颇_寅虎·御盾_移动语音2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"我的武道守则，茶泡七分好，劲发九分妙。","hasText":true,"duration":6.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/178/06491648BECC71000183634333639383636.mp3"},{"id":"06044648BECC71000183132353232363539","heroId":"178","skinId":"392","skinName":"寅虎·御盾","title":"廉颇_寅虎·御盾_移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"武者虽强，但以武服人，却非真正的武道。","hasText":true,"duration":5.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/178/06044648BECC71000183132353232363539.mp3"},{"id":"06505648BECC71000183737343133323232","heroId":"178","skinId":"392","skinName":"寅虎·御盾","title":"廉颇_寅虎·御盾_移动语音5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"不管任何时候，都不可放弃必胜的信念！","hasText":true,"duration":4.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/178/06505648BECC71000183737343133323232.mp3"},{"id":"06127648BECC71000183832303632363232","heroId":"178","skinId":"392","skinName":"寅虎·御盾","title":"廉颇_寅虎·御盾_移动语音1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"要练拳，先练心。","hasText":true,"duration":2.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/178/06127648BECC71000183832303632363232.mp3"},{"id":"06038648BECC61000183138313134373734","heroId":"178","skinId":"392","skinName":"寅虎·御盾","title":"廉颇_寅虎·御盾_大厅语音1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"年兽出现，猛虎也该苏醒了，同此心，共此力！","hasText":true,"duration":20.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/178/06038648BECC61000183138313134373734.mp3"},{"id":"06683648BECC61000183235343934343139","heroId":"178","skinId":"392","skinName":"寅虎·御盾","title":"廉颇_寅虎·御盾_大厅语音3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"习武不是争强，而是立一道门，护一方人。","hasText":true,"duration":20.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/178/